          "Mi esperas, ke vi fartas bone.        Press 2",
          "= I hope (that) you're well.",
          "Mi scias, ke ĝi estas facila.         Press 3",
          "= I know (that) it's easy.",
          "",
          "ALWAYS A COMMA BEFORE KE.",
          "English may drop 'that'. Esperanto never",
          "drops KE:",
          "Mi opinias, ke ni devas atendi.       Press 4",
          "= I think we have to wait."
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
